 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ekCRFW_-xB8Q7kNvwEVpy33&_nc_oc=AdqRNv8rSxDwp7I6C0qZQOPcamUN4qf1w9JNR2DY86LKiP1eZThIgXl_zK97r5Cttac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGlzByIpxr3GAbmZUidUQyxunNSuZ1eYhq2T0KS92ryMw&oe=6A7B0501"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8bnIg6wPJ0AQ7kNvwGi7JHm&_nc_oc=AdqLn3tFdN1lITvzi3n8xcbO59p9HsLFE6NGqOipKf0vrKxKr5xKnbznRY_pFJ45N0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGKCPRrb4XrjLCtsDi7p46NswNpVpM8fdkuMIXke9uEdg&oe=6A7B1266"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8pElIaBEgfQQ7kNvwHgRGC-&_nc_oc=AdqoyDxU5GWFEVbmqwg1qcCRI9NurXL9KRYLA_JxJ18k_AWnfEGRqsY-lVLBeeg_h_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGpl4BkQUo97wypKDOTqjdlDZoNSoF9VPmDY9L4fP3uQg&oe=6A7B1C5C"}, {"fil